msgid ""
"Add a new field to an existing IvyForms form. Supported types: text, "
"textarea, email, number, phone, website, name, radio, checkbox, select, "
"multi-select, address, date, time, rating, html. When IvyForms Pro is "
"active, password and signature are also supported. After adding a field, use "
"open-form-builder to let the user see and configure."
msgstr ""
"Añade un nuevo campo a un formulario de IvyForms existente. Tipos "
"compatibles: text, textarea, email, number, phone, website, name, radio, "
"checkbox, select, multi-select, address, date, time, rating, html. Cuando "
"IvyForms Pro está activado, también se admiten password y signature. Después "
"de añadir un campo, utiliza open-form-builder para que el usuario pueda "
"verlo y configurarlo."

